# Copy to <config>/cron-jobs/notify.conf to enable phone push on job failure,
# where <config> is ${SYSTEM_TOOLS_CONFIG:-${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/system}.
# Pick a long random topic name — anyone who knows it can read/post to it:
#   NTFY_TOPIC="cron-jobs-$(uuidgen | tr A-Z a-z)"
# Then install the ntfy app (iOS/Android) and subscribe to the same topic.
NTFY_TOPIC=""
